3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,933
这不是科幻电影
This is not a science fiction film.

4
00:00:06,933 --> 00:00:08,100
也不是概念PPT啊
And it is not just a concept presentation.

5
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,600
车子能够在空中翻滚
The car can flip in mid-air.

6
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,133
能吸附在墙面上
It can stick to a wall.

7
00:00:12,133 --> 00:00:13,833
