and a top speed of 370 kilometres per hour.

22
00:00:36,667 --> 00:00:40,167
可以正常上路上牌在公路上行驶
It can get a licence plate and drive on public roads.

23
00:00:40,167 --> 00:00:41,467
除了这台车呢
Beyond this car,

