直接可以调用Claude Code的Opus 5.5
you can directly call Claude Code's Opus 5.5.

34
00:01:04,433 --> 00:01:05,367
Grok呢
Grok

35
00:01:05,367 --> 00:01:06,867
现在充当的呢
is now acting as

